OL,3,ADolly Parton laid to rest alongside
OL,4,Ahusband in Nashville
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton has been laid to rest, the
OL,7,Fmusic legend's great-niece has said.
OL,9,FThe singer had a private family funeral
OL,10,Fin Nashville on Friday, following her
OL,11,Fdeath earlier in the week at the age of
OL,12,F80.
OL,14,FShe has been placed next to her late
OL,15,Fhusband, Carl Dean, at Woodlawn
OL,16,FMemorial Park and Mausoleum in the
OL,17,FTennessee city.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
