OL,3,AThis actor was told he had Alzheimer's,
OL,4,Anow he's performing a one-man show
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor four days running, Peter Marinker
OL,7,Fhad arrived at rehearsals that were not
OL,8,Feven taking place. Dementia had muddled
OL,9,Fthe dates in his mind.
OL,11,FYet he is now preparing to do something
OL,12,Fmost actors would find daunting even
OL,13,Fwith perfect recall: performing a
OL,14,Fmuch-loved Samuel Beckett play alone on
OL,15,Fa London stage.
OL,17,FMarinker, 85, is best known for his
OL,18,Fvoice work: from radio plays and video
OL,19,Fgames to big-budget films like
OL,20,FLabyrinth and Paddington in Peru.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
